                <pb facs="0190" n="82" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg82"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Thompson to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Petropolis</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-12-09"><hi rendition="#italic">December 9, 1893</hi></date>.
                        (Received December 10.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Thompson, referring to his dispatch No. 74, reports that Admiral da Gama has
                    declared in favor of a restoration of the Government such as it existed before
                    the Republic was established and joined the cause of the insurgents.</p>
            </div>
